profiles inspect --catalog ABS_FILE
profiles resolve --catalog ABS_FILE [--profile NAME]
profiles route PLAN --policy FILE [--out NEWPLAN]
profiles migrate-prepare --run RUN --profile NAME --executable FILE --out PROPOSAL
profiles migrate-apply --run RUN --proposal FILE --approve DIGEST --confirm-stopped
Inspect/resolve/route/prepare do not dispatch or change run configuration. Route writes a new plan only with --out. Apply records an explicitly approved future executable binding.
